    },
    {
      "id": "blk_df7fce0b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在罗伊族的古老传说中，██源自比拉海洛更幽深的所在。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_9cbafccb",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "传说称，那是灾厄的根源，就在现今坠剑湖的下方。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_73257e6d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【00:03:49】",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 5,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 6,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c1709493",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "黑海岸监测确认，██的频率分布异常，出现“双源”结构：",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 6,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 7,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_72bc8242",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "A 点——拉海洛，周期性出现的████区；",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 7,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 8,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_bc19d658",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "B 点——坠剑湖底，信号极弱，似受干扰。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 8,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 9,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_376c95fe",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【00:05:02】",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 9,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 10,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c673bf1d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "科考队沿信号潜入湖底，发现███结构，形态类似████，",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 10,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 11,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_ec2d30af",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "该██倒悬的███相连，主体深植地底，",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 11,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 12,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_b2de185d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "██延伸至更上层地质带，推测指向浮光林。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 12,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 13,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_98a3286b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【00:05:44】",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 13,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 14,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_7f976380",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "▇▇材质与隧者一致，表层纹理具明显的▇▇特征，仿佛意在▇▇某种存在。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 14,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 15,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_5c67609c",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "而来自炉芯的能量流经███，不断注入并滋养着██内部，",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 15,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 16,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_b62b6764",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "疑似维持着某种封闭系统。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 16,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 17,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_8ca9ea66",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【00:06:22】",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 17,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 18,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_a7684945",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "泰缇斯确认：微弱██频率来自██之后。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 18,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 19,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_40f7751b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "研究院进而提出多种假设，主流倾向认为：",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 19,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 20,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_650a8ab9",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "▇▇下方，或存在连结▇▇▇▇的▇▇。▇▇的存在，正是为了断绝▇▇。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 20,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 21,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_3b8bb237",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "▇▇仅封闭了部分▇▇；另一部分▇▇至拉海洛，以虚质磁暴与▇▇▇的形式继续存在。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 21,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 22,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_fcc941d5",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【00:07:01】",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 22,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 23,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_166c1e6a",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "若▇▇遭到破坏，离散为双源性的▇▇将重新聚合，",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 23,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 24,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_8261094d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "获得完整形态——那将是……索拉里斯的▇▇。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 24,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 25,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_5110359b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【00:08:33】",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 25,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 26,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_22bc43ba",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "而根据罗伊族的进一步记载，▇▇之后，正是隧者的来路。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 26,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 27,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_58efde4d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "这条“来路”或许是一道真正意义上的▇▇，连接着▇▇▇▇。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 27,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 28,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_341109e1",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "【00:09:10】",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 28,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 29,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_e1a9ff90",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "门后的世界究竟为何？",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 29,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 30,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_682fc5f9",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "▇▇▇？宇宙？天空海阻断了我们向上的路；",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 30,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 31,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_e16211ec",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "这条「向下」之路，也许是唯一的▇。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 31,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 32,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
